meta {
  name: 03 Me
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/me
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Cookie: copilot_session={{copilot_session}}
}

docs {
  Quick standalone check of whether the copilot_session environment variable
  (see bruno/README.md) is currently set to a real, still-valid session --
  cheaper than running a full /chat request just to find out.

  Two real outcomes, both confirmed live 2026-09-20:
  - copilot_session unset/stale: 401 {"authenticated": false}
  - copilot_session set to a real, still-valid session: 200
    {"authenticated": true, "resident": "<resident uuid>"}

  Run this first if a /chat or /patient request unexpectedly 401s, to check
  whether the cookie itself is the problem before debugging anything else.
}
